<h3 class="section-heading" id="common-advanced-modifiers">Common advanced modifiers</h3>
<p>The modifiers players reach for most often. Read these for movement and feel; the structural readings live in the advanced reference below.</p>

<p>
  Named launch and set systems (pixie, fairy, atomic, quantum, furious, and the
  rest) are set vocabulary, defined in the
  <a href="#section-timing-sets">Timing &amp; Sets</a> chapter. Dex side
  relationships (same / opposite, near / far) and X-Dex eligibility live in the
  <a href="#section-dexterities">Dexterities</a> chapter. This chapter keeps the
  transformations that reshape a base once it is under way.
</p>
